WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Hello friends. I'm Steve Mona. I'm Pete McDaniel. Craig Kirby here. I'm DeBert Cook, and I'm honored to be part of the Celebrate 120 Advisory Committee.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:20.500
2026 represents a historical milestone in Gulf's history. We are coming together to recognize two historic anniversaries.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.500
Clearview Golf Course, known as America's Course, will celebrate its 80th year of continuous operation.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
The National Black Golf Hall of Fame, founded by Harold Donovan, celebrates its 40th anniversary.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
These two organizations have come together collectively to celebrate this historical moment.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.500
120 years celebrating Gulf's Black history.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.500
We invite you to join us on Friday and Saturday, October 2nd and 3rd,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.500
at the historic Clearview Golf Course in East Canton, Ohio.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:58.500
120 years celebrating Gulf's Black history.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.500
We are commemorating Celebration 120.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:09.500
We look forward to seeing you there. I look forward to seeing you there. I'll be there. I want you. Peace.
